<span id="A4.T4.2.1.1.1.2.10" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">False Positiive Rate <math id="A4.T4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span>
